      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，当 chunked=false 时，文档说明会执行完整 PCA/截断 SVD，并参考 svd_solver 与 zero_center 的设置。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "If `False`, perform a full PCA/truncated SVD (see `svd_solver` and `zero_center`)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "当 zero_center=false 时，文档说明执行的是截断 SVD 而不是 PCA。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：截断 SVD 分支的完整实现条件需要同时满足 chunked=false 且 zero_center=false；仅凭 zero_center=false 不能单独确定该分支，也不能据此断言无条件执行截断 SVD。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：稀疏矩阵的高效主成分计算目前仅支持 arpack 或 covariance_eigh 求解器，这属于可检测性/适用性说明，不代表对稠密矩阵或本次调用结果的硬性限制。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Efficient computation of the principal components of a sparse matrix\n        currently only works with the `'arpack`' or `'covariance_eigh`' solver."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": ""
}
